WEBVTT

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:18.040
Now there’s a sight fer the eyes.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:23.110
He’s got himself two championship belts. Takamura’s done good fer himself.

00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:25.150
Yeah, he did well.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.510
So are yew finally gonna tell her?

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.880
Yew coming up to the cabin?

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:37.010
When I went after the Hawk fight, I vowed to tell her after I fulfilled the other half of my promise.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.340
So I can’t go yet.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:41.300
So yew say.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.800
Yew haven’t changed, Gen-chan.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.140
Excuse me!

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:48.400
Nekota-san, will this work?

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.000
Yeah, that’ll do.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.730
Coach, isn’t that you and Nekota-san in that photo?

00:00:55.730 --> 00:00:56.150
Yes.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.660
Who’s that woman?

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:01.800
She’s beautiful.

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:07.620
That gal’s Yuki-san.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.880
Yuki-san?

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:13.640
I promised her that one of my 
protégés would conquer the world.

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.780
But she’s long dead.

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.960
She was the flower of our youth.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:21.650
W-Why’d yew do that?

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:24.080
Don’t run your mouth!

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.580
Are you trying to embarrass me in front of my boxers?

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.660
Oh, beg yer <i>pardon!</i>

00:01:29.580 --> 00:01:31.240
It had to be a closed fist?

00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:33.450
Just an old habit of mine.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:35.580
You’re messing with a former boxer, you know!

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:37.960
Yew threw the first punch!

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.670
Please stop, both of you!

00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:43.420
They took out the current national champion!

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:45.850
Sorry ‘bout that.

00:01:45.850 --> 00:01:46.890
I-It’s fine.

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:49.600
That was pathetic. We’re retraining!

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:51.930
You two were too strong.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:58.480
But if you’re this strong now, you two must have been very powerful in your prime.

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:01.550
Back then, you’d have two or three fights in a day,

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:05.080
and the referee didn’t stop those fights till someone went down for the count.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:08.080
You had to be a gutsy guy to box then!

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.630
Gen-chan here was a real bruiser.

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:16.700
He coulda been a world champion before Shirai Yoshio.

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:19.280
The world champion? Holy...

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:20.960
Then that means Nekota-san also...

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.000
He’s blowing it out of proportion.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.580
Don’t believe everything you hear.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:28.840
Our heyday done ended along with the War.

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:32.430
Boy were we short on luck.

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:35.850
No, I disagree.

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.010
I count myself lucky.

00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:39.100
The times may have changed,

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:42.050
but I’ve realized my dream.

00:02:47.110 --> 00:02:49.990
Yew almost moved this old dog to tears.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:52.240
You’ve done conquered the world.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:54.180
I didn’t conquer anything.

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:57.280
Nope! That’s my take on it!

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.500
When I saw Takamura take on that American,

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:04.420
I couldn’t help envisioning that one fight yew had.

00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:07.300
You took on an American, Coach?

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:15.360
You youngsters might think this tale is older than ancient history.

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.910
But when I close my eyes, it’s as clear as yesterday.

00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:23.550
The shock from our fall and the destitution.

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:28.060
But we knew we had to rise above all that.

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:32.820
We had to focus on our revival and regain our strength.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:38.270
That time was hot... and full of passions.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.350
Give us some, Dankichi!

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:12.650
Yew ain’t eating that white rice alone!

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:17.330
Shove off! This was paid for with the blood from my last fight!

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:20.160
You want to eat? Earn it with your boxing gloves!

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.260
Oh, yeah.

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:26.920
You dragged out last week’s fight to a draw, so you both got nothing.

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:30.460
So next time get a KO.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.910
It’s obvious that I won that fight!

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.690
Yew were ‘bout to collapse!

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:36.790
You were puking at the end of rounds!

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.680
Only ‘cause I had to see yer balls hanging out!

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:41.280
Cut that out!

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.770
You fought an even fight.

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:45.220
Yeah, says the wimpy boxer!

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.060
That white rice made yew uppity!

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.770
This is one fight you <i>don’t</i>  want!

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.040
You wanna settle this?!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.130
Damn right I do!

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:53.200
Yer on!

00:04:58.950 --> 00:04:59.260
You...

00:04:59.260 --> 00:04:59.930
Bastard!

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.080
Assholes!

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.680
You think I can run right after eating?

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.210
This won’t decide anything!

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:12.680
And those guys...

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:17.220
they beat the living crap out of each other in the ring.

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.010
But looking at them now...

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:25.230
they look like... best friends.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:31.970
I-I can’t run no more.

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:35.970
T-Then that means I won.

00:05:36.780 --> 00:05:39.850
B-But I was out in front!

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:42.310
Y-You collapsed first though!

00:05:43.700 --> 00:05:45.230
Screw this.

00:05:45.230 --> 00:05:47.580
Let’s declare a truce.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:50.680
I guess... I’ll take yew up on that.

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:00.680
Humans are pretty amazing.

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:01.760
Huh?

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:06.110
Two years ago, this place was leveled by bombs.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:10.720
We thought nothing could be built from those ruins.

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:15.290
But little by little, we are reviving and rising from the ashes.

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:20.580
Even the people coming to watch our fights seem more chipper.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:26.410
Maybe they’re comparing us to the people who fight real battles.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:30.310
So we’re playing a big part in the revival?

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.530
I couldn’t be any happier knowing that.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.420
Yeah.

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:37.560
We may be has-been boxers who are both pushing 30,

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:42.550
but knowing we’re giving these people courage makes yew wanna fight forever, don’t it?

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.640
Dankichi’s got another fight in two days.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.760
Dunno who he’s fighting, though.

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:52.560
That guy’s got a glass jaw so I’m worried.

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:56.400
Did he knock him down already?!

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:59.110
Kamogawa! Dankichi’s in bad shape!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.130
What?!

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:01.570
Not the other way around?!

00:07:01.570 --> 00:07:03.820
Hey! Who the hell is he fighting?

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.460
<i>Blond hair?</i>

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:10.960
<i>A GI?</i>

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:17.050
Dankichi! Yew all right?

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:18.980
M-My chin...

00:07:18.980 --> 00:07:21.340
Don’t worry, he’ll live!

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:27.630
We came to this ring for a friendly match.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:32.800
We don’t want to injure you Japanese any further after that miserable war you fought.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:36.790
He thinks we’re mud! That's how he really feels!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.230
Cool it, Nekota!

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:45.870
If he thinks all of us will hang our heads in front of American GIs, he better think again!

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:46.490
Nekota!

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.380
He’s a big one.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:56.430
Do it, Miguel.

00:07:56.430 --> 00:07:57.250
Sir!

00:07:58.770 --> 00:08:00.760
These are for women and children!

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:02.680
We bear gifts!

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:05.260
Clothes, chocolates, gum, and bread!

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:08.500
Women and children first! Come get it!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:11.450
Don’t yew dare take them!

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:14.180
Don’t yew see them laughing?! Don’t yew?!

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.270
Nekota!

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:20.070
They just saw a fellow Japanese man pummeled, and yet...

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:28.450
If I’d met him in the battlefield, 
I woulda completely ventilated him!

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:31.960
Stand down. That’s our only option.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:34.870
These are the times we’re living in.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:40.840
Yeah, but... we’re reduced to taking things that have touched the ground.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.390
A-Aren’t yew gonna pick that up?

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:54.050
Yew better do it before it’s gone.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.600
It’s still valuable.

00:08:57.210 --> 00:09:01.630
To pick one up would be to throw away...

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.790
my pride as a Japanese person.

00:09:07.590 --> 00:09:10.740
Thank God Dankichi didn’t get hurt bad.

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:14.730
Yew mean thank God he went down with one punch.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.480
You said it.

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:19.040
Guess it’s good that he can’t take a hit.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:23.050
From what I could see, he went down when they swung at each other.

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:27.050
He used a counter!

00:09:27.050 --> 00:09:29.000
“Counter”?

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.560
A punch that uses the opponent’s momentum against him.

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:33.520
It’s a high-level technique.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:36.270
The guy back there was at least a lightweight.

00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:40.630
Us bantamweights wouldn’t stand a chance.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:43.400
Yew can pound any sized boxer with some elbow grease!

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.180
With that old Japanese spirit!

00:09:45.180 --> 00:09:49.010
And we can rush Sherman tanks with bamboo lances!

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:51.530
That’s exactly what they told us during the war!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.790
Listen.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.630
Don’t start thinking about getting revenge.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:02.590
American boxing is a decade ahead of Japanese boxing.

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:06.050
No, even a decade might be underestimating it.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.980
They stick to their proper weight classes.

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:12.390
They also know how to maintain healthy bodies.

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:15.480
Their scientific advances easily eclipse whatever guts we have.

00:10:15.480 --> 00:10:18.320
Yew damn America lover! That’s enough outta yew!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:21.480
Cool it! You think I like any of this?!

00:10:25.320 --> 00:10:26.530
Still,

00:10:27.570 --> 00:10:30.070
their way of fighting is different from ours.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.680
Yew think there are different ways of slugging it out?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:36.110
Believe me, it’s way different.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.200
It’s not our fighting.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:41.080
It’s real boxing.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.630
<i>Real boxing?</i>

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:48.840
If I’m going to become a better fighter, I must learn its ways.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:51.530
It’s a big world out there!

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:55.570
Our country might have lost, but I’m still here!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:11:00.450
I want to see how far this one fist will lead me!

00:11:00.450 --> 00:11:02.850
I hope I’ll learn everything along the way!

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:05.780
Well I ain’t an America lover.

00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:07.540
I’m fighting using <i>our</i>  style.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.690
Nekota!

00:11:08.690 --> 00:11:12.360
Relax. I’ve settled down for now.

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.870
I even saw a ray of hope.

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:17.870
Hope?

00:11:19.160 --> 00:11:21.910
<i>My pride as a Japanese person.</i>

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:24.110
Those were some fine words.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:27.980
Never knew we had girls left who could come up with those lines.

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:30.520
You’re always a sucker for pretty lookers.

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:34.180
Ooh, I knew it! Yew think she’s cute too, huh?

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:38.680
Wonder if she came to see the fight.

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:42.190
Hope we get to meet again.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.460
Save me!

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:47.030
What’s with yew?!

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:50.190
You were that-

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.950
Hand over that girl, jap.

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:59.950
I repeat, hand over that girl!

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.420
It’s the GI Dankichi fought!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.830
So he’s the one chasing yew?!

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.550
Tell ‘em, Miguel.

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:09.340
Sir!

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.740
This is what Anderson is saying:

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:14.830
Things became boring after he stopped seeing action on the battlefront!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.890
He’s trying to add some excitement to his life!

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:21.590
The man from this afternoon riled him up!

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:27.610
He wanted to snuff out his life, but you Japanese turned out to be too weak!

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.560
Yew bastard...

00:12:29.560 --> 00:12:33.170
In order to escape the crippling boredom of this country, you Japanese...

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:35.910
must provide...

00:12:35.910 --> 00:12:39.240
...men to punch and women to sleep with.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.750
Yew ain’t stopping me, Kamogawa!

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:41.370
Nekota!

00:12:42.450 --> 00:12:43.700
Yer dead!

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:49.630
<i>He started with two lefts.</i>

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:53.130
<i>That gave him time to gauge the distance, then came the killer right.</i>

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:56.180
Nekota!

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:03.390
<i>What the hell was that?</i>

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:03.890
Kamogawa!

00:13:04.370 --> 00:13:06.640
<i>A right? Was that his right?!</i>

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:11.940
<i>Wait... was that a cross counter?</i>

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:33.250
My name is Miguel Zail.

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:36.400
You can relax, you brave Japanese.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:39.010
Sergeant Anderson is fully satisfied.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:41.530
Y-Yer still here?

00:13:41.530 --> 00:13:42.680
Damn you...

00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:48.650
Please believe me. We Americans are not all like Anderson.

00:13:48.650 --> 00:13:52.190
We truly seek to form cordial relations with you people.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.620
He is just a dangerous exception.

00:13:58.180 --> 00:13:59.950
And one more thing:

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.700
Do not think about getting payback.

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:06.730
Your brand of boxing is nothing like our boxing.

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:09.210
You have no chance of winning.

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:22.400
They’re not just a decade ahead.

00:14:23.080 --> 00:14:25.060
They’re at least a century ahead of us.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.280
Why’re yew acting so impressed?!

00:14:27.280 --> 00:14:29.530
Yew should be crying bitter tears!

00:14:29.530 --> 00:14:30.780
Yew should...

00:14:31.920 --> 00:14:33.720
If I could do it...

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:39.020
I would go running after them... get my revenge...

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:41.090
No.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:45.890
I’d get my payback in the ring like a real boxer would.

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:48.430
In... the ring?

00:14:49.340 --> 00:14:53.730
But I know that’s not going to happen.

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:57.380
Once we lace up our gloves, we know who’s going to win.

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:59.800
Yew saying we should move on?

00:14:59.800 --> 00:15:02.000
And forget this humiliation?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.650
Crap, I totally forgot!

00:15:04.650 --> 00:15:07.100
Yeah, where’d that woman go?!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:09.100
Did they take her with them?

00:15:10.890 --> 00:15:11.810
I’m...

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:14.220
I’m so sorry.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:19.150
I was so scared stiff that I couldn’t get away.

00:15:19.620 --> 00:15:20.780
So you’re all right.

00:15:20.780 --> 00:15:22.410
Thank God.

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:24.830
I’m sorry! I’m so sorry!

00:15:24.830 --> 00:15:28.160
You two got hurt because of me!

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:30.480
So, um...

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:35.170
You’re Kamogawa-san and Nekota-san, aren’t you?

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:39.280
Oh, you saw our fight?

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:42.430
So that means yew love boxing, um...

00:15:42.430 --> 00:15:44.380
My name’s Yuki.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:47.300
I love boxing, and you were both wonderful.

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.860
Oh, so it’s Yuki-san.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:51.440
Yew got yerself a nice name!

00:15:51.440 --> 00:15:55.310
S-So those GIs were chasing yew when yew were looking for a place to sleep?

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:58.820
Yew should come to my place. 
It holds up pretty well in a storm.

00:15:58.820 --> 00:15:59.880
Oh, I...

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:03.210
You’re gonna put her up <i>there?</i>

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.640
Your “home” is some corner under a bridge covered in a mat!

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:08.250
D-Don’t yew tell her!

00:16:08.250 --> 00:16:12.280
Anyway, you’re not going to find any lodging at this hour.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:14.380
I’ve got two rooms at my place.

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.780
You can borrow one.

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.080
B-But...

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:20.740
What’s his deal?

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:22.590
So...

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:25.720
Is it really okay if I stay at your place?

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:28.850
I don’t have anywhere else to go.

00:16:31.530 --> 00:16:33.350
Is this your place?

00:16:33.350 --> 00:16:37.000
I’m not using the other bus, so make yourself at home there.

00:16:37.000 --> 00:16:37.860
Thank you very mu-

00:16:37.860 --> 00:16:39.860
No, thank <i>yew!</i>

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.630
I’m gonna move in.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:44.490
I’ll enjoy staying at yer digs!

00:16:47.270 --> 00:16:49.780
Why the hell do I have to live with <i>you?!</i>

00:16:49.780 --> 00:16:54.040
Having a guy and gal spend the night together is too iffy, so I’m keeping watch!

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:57.230
I know for a fact that yer a hopeless sex deviant!

00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.520
I’ll lay you flat!

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:00.420
My intentions are not what you think!

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:02.420
Welcome back!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.680
You two wake up very early.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:10.350
I get up to run every morning.

00:17:10.350 --> 00:17:14.390
Well, it’s not something any woman can understand, so I won’t try to explain it.

00:17:14.390 --> 00:17:17.030
My, how very discourteous of yew.

00:17:17.030 --> 00:17:20.690
I must say, this is good. I’m glad I moved in.

00:17:20.690 --> 00:17:23.200
I slept very well last night.

00:17:23.200 --> 00:17:25.880
I didn’t feel alone for the first time in a long time.

00:17:26.700 --> 00:17:30.060
I wasn’t able to tell last night because it was so dark,

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.950
but everything’s so pretty here.

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:35.750
I really love these flowers.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:41.210
They grow tall while facing the sun, and their blossoms are large.

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:45.180
They really make you feel cheerful.

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:52.180
They make a good replacement for hedges-

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.350
Don’t spoil the mood!

00:17:54.350 --> 00:17:56.750
I also love sunflowers!

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:57.980
You do?

00:17:57.980 --> 00:17:59.530
That’s news to me!

00:17:59.530 --> 00:18:01.260
It was a secret!

00:18:01.260 --> 00:18:02.980
This is such a wonderful place.

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:05.610
W-Well, glad yew like it!

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:08.600
If yew want, yew can make this yer permanent home.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:10.420
Go to hell!

00:18:10.420 --> 00:18:13.620
Where do you even get off?! 
You think this is your damn house?!

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:17.890
Do whatever the hell you want!

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:20.250
All right!

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:24.000
You can do it, you two!

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:24.840
Yeah!

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:26.300
Quit running in front!

00:18:37.600 --> 00:18:38.600
I won!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:39.480
Yes!

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:42.080
Don’t touch me.

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:43.310
It doesn’t feel right.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.060
But he won...

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:49.320
Kamogawa’s turned boxing into some kind of religion.

00:18:49.320 --> 00:18:52.190
I’ll have dinner ready for you guys!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.820
I can hardly wait!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:02.330
I can’t even concentrate on my boxing thanks to you guys barging in!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:04.700
Yer just weak in spirit.

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:07.550
I, for one, am racking up more KOs.

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:12.090
You’re also taking more hits thanks to that gung-ho attitude of yours.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:15.000
I was gonna dodge 'em all.

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.640
But for some reason, they were still able to land 'em.

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.980
You wanted to look good in front of her!

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.960
I didn’t want to say it,

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:26.980
but the only thing good about your boxing is what we would call your animal instincts.

00:19:27.560 --> 00:19:30.000
You’re letting other people besides me beat you stupid!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:31.740
Shut up.

00:19:31.740 --> 00:19:33.230
Just listen!

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:35.410
It’s great that you want to look good for a woman...

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:36.750
I do!

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:40.330
Hey...

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:44.910
She’s bright, cheerful, and upright,

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:47.710
just like a sunflower.

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:49.450
Well, yeah.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.830
Any guy would like her.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.590
Including yew,

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:55.480
right?

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:00.130
I won’t lose.
